<title>USA: Sigma-Aldrich signs global marketing pact.</title>
<headline>Sigma-Aldrich signs global marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sigma Diagnostics unit of Sigma-Aldrich Corp said it signed a global partnership agreement with Heinrich Amelung GmbH to sell Amelung coagulation instruments worldwide.</p>
<p>Germany's Amelung will focus on development and manufacturing of coagulation instruments, while Sigma will handle marketing and sales, as well as development of coagulation reagents.</p>
<p>The new agreement expands a 15-year business agreement signed in 1995 that allows Sigma Diagnostics to distribute Amelung hemostasis systems into the U.S. and Canadian markets.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
